ana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">98.7</span></font></p>\n</td>\n<td width=\"494\">\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font color=\"fuchsia\" face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">113.1</span></font></p>\n</td>\n<td width=\"494\">\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">&nbsp;</span></font></p>\n</td>\n<td width=\"494\">\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">&nbsp;</span></font></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"6\" width=\"494\">\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:10px;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><b><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">드래곤</span></b><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">의 \n                            최소 테임시도 스킬은 93.9입니다.</span></font></p>\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:10px;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">테임에 \n                            성공한후 테임이 풀렸을때 다른이가 테임을 하게되면</span></font></p>\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:10px;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">93.9로서 \n                            테임이 시도가 되지만 실제 그용의 테임난이도는 98.7정도로서 \n                            올라가게 됩니다.</span></font></p>\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:10px;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">그러므로 \n                            자신이 스킬타임 시간대라면 실패해도 스킬이 올라감으로 \n                            여러사람들이 \n                            테임한 동물을</span></font></p>\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:10px;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">테임하는게 \n                            스킬을 올리는데 유리합니다.</span></font></p>\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:10px;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">빠른 \n                                        스폰을 위해 직접 죽이는것도 좋습니다.</span></font></p>\n<p style=\"line-height:50%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:10px;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:10px;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">드래곤,화웜,스웜프드래곤,나메는 \n                                        20번 테임시도에 1번꼴로 테임시도가 됩니다.</span></font></p>\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:10px;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">보통 \n                                        \"당신은 그동물을 화나게 하는 것 같습니다\"라는 \n\n                            메시지가 보입니다.</span></font></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<table align=\"center\" bordercolordark=\"#A0965A\" bordercolorlight=\"#999933\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\" width=\"100%\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td width=\"298\">\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:8;\"><a href=\"/site/skill_index/uo_skill/\"><b><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"><font color=\"black\" face=\"Verdana\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"20\" src=\"/img/posts/site/skill_knowhow/images/menu.gif\" width=\"30\"></font></span></b></a></p>\n</td>\n<td width=\"295\">\n<p align=\"right\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-right:10; margin-bottom:0;\"><a href=\"#top\"><b><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"><font color=\"black\" face=\"Verdana\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"20\" src=\"/img/posts/site/skill_knowhow/images/top.gif\" width=\"20\"></font></span></b></a></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">&nbsp;</span></font><font color=\"#333333\" face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">이표는 </span></font><a href=\"http://uo.stratics.com/\" target=\"_blank\"><font color=\"#333333\" face=\"Verdana\"><b><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">UOSS</span></b></font></a><font color=\"#333333\" face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">에서 \n나온표입니다</span></font></p>\n<p align=\"right\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font color=\"black\" face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">&nbsp;</span></font></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td background=\"/img/posts/site/skill_knowhow/images/memo_b.gif\" height=\"20\" width=\"630\"><p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font color=\"black\" face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">&nbsp;<img border=\"0\" height=\"15\" src=\"/img/posts/site/skill_knowhow/images/b_logo.gif\" width=\"100\"></span></font></p></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table></div>\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font color=\"black\" face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">&nbsp;</span></font></p>\n"
